                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/star-autonomous+category"} star-autonomous category
            %li
              %p
                A linearly distributive category in which the units of the two monoidal structures coincide is an (iso-)
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mix+category"}> mix category
                \.
            %li
